WEBVTT

00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:02.601
and they settled
in Los Altos, California --

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:04.976
the Silicon Valley
before the Silicon Valley --

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.601
and they started a restaurant
called Chef Chu's.

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:11.351
50 years later, today,
they still work at the restaurant,

00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.643
they're still there,

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:14.518
and I grew up there, so it was great.

00:02:14.542 --> 00:02:17.434
Talk about connection --
this place was a hub of connection.

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:21.893
People coming there to celebrate
birthdays, anniversaries, business deals,

00:02:21.917 --> 00:02:23.184
eating, drinking --

00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:24.476
connection.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.476
And I got to grow up in that environment.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.851
And my parents always said America
is the greatest place in the world.

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.143
You can --